MapResult -[hidden]down- IdRegistry
IdRegistry -[hidden]down- UpperStubReplacer
OntologyCurator -[hidden]down- OntoGPTExtractor
ExtendReport -[hidden]down- RobotModuleExtractor
' layout only: package rows
P__top_level_ -[hidden]down- P_connectors
P__top_level_ -[hidden]down- P_llm
P__top_level_ -[hidden]down- P_embedding
