PubMedQueryValidator ..> QueryReport : «create»
BaseConnector <|-- UMLSConnector
DataManager ..> OWLOntology : «create»
CQResult --> "1" CompetencyQuestion : cq
CQResult --> "1" Verdict : verdict
ConceptLattice --> "1" DataManager : dm
ConceptLattice --> "1" ContextMatrix : matrix
ContextMatrix --> "1" DataManager : dm
GraphVisualizer ..> KnowledgeGraphRepository : «create»
BaseHierarchy --> "1" DataManager : dm
BaseHierarchy <|-- ClassHierarchy
ClassHierarchy <|-- ClassHierarchyView
ClassHierarchyView --> "1" DataManager : dm
BaseHierarchy <|-- FCAHierarchy
