ExtractionResult --> "*" ExtractedRelation : relations
LLMClient ..> ExtractedEntity : «create»
LLMClient ..> ExtractionResult : «create»
Entity --> "*" FCAAttribute : true_attributes
Entity --> "*" FCAAttribute : false_attributes
